se, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203902161", "author": {"steamid": "76561198323597930", "personaname": "KingLeopoldo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198323597930/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 11079, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 39, "playtime_at_review": 10837, "last_played": 1787867473, "avatar": "21ee3bd41e81999a4f984a5b82078fd54dbd7227"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Juegazo. La última actualización basura, imposible de jugar. Ahora mismo, una estafa", "timestamp_created": 1757363986, "timestamp_updated": 1757363986, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "203901309", "author": {"steamid": "76561198277676356", "personaname": "Dayansirris", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198277676356/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4157, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 569, "playtime_at_review": 501, "last_played": 1787868771, "avatar": "c0c868e026aa56e31fa1ba9df69fbb3525ab9813"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Tremendo juegazo. Realmente me gusta mucho el sistema de niveles y cómo aumenta la dificultad, hasta casi volarte la cabeza (literal) con la exigencia que demandan los niveles altos. Es una locura. Realmente es lo que esperaba de este juego: un caos total, al igual que es un caos su optimización. Nada malo que decir, más que algo tan importante como su optimización. De resto, es increíble.", "timestamp_created": 1757363058, "timestamp_updated": 1757363058, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "ste